    },
    {
      "text": "自动开火与少量移动技能键降低上手门槛，但敌群会随波次持续增多变强。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Simple controls such as auto-firing weapons and a few buttons for movements and skill uses, You can easily and quickly adapt and get into yourself in the game. But, as the waves progress, the enemies gradually increase in number and strength",
